    "Status" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Status"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stav"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Status"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Estado"}},"fil":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Katayuan"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"État"}},"hr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Status"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stato"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"状態"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"상태"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Status"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stan"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Status"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Состояние"}},"sk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stav"}},"so":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Xaalad"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Durum"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Стан"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"状态"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"狀態"}}}},
